{"id":"7b6c17ff29c3fd9b","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-currying.md","title":"一阶系统的柯里化","display":"df-currying — 一阶系统的柯里化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-currying","aliases":["56-df-currying"],"display":"df-currying — 一阶系统的柯里化","depends_on":["[[56-df-applicative-trs]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.24, printed p74","source_ocr_block":"95","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-currying"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-currying</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-currying — 一阶系统的柯里化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1da4ab3df97a0b08\" href=\"?note=1da4ab3df97a0b08\" title=\"56-df-applicative-trs\">56-df-applicative-trs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definition 3.3.24, printed p74"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"95"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>。取二元新符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ap}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ap}\\)</span>，以及与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\cup V\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\">\\(F\\cup V\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\)</span> 不交的一族互异常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f\">\\(c_f\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>）。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\">\\(n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in T\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in T\\)</span>。在目标应用记法中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_ft_1\\cdots t_n\">\\(c_ft_1\\cdots t_n\\)</span> 按左结合解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\cup\\{c_f:f\\in F\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(c_f)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\cup\\{c_f:f\\in F\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(c_f)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V),\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}:T\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V),\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}:T\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cur}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq c_f\\mathrm{cur}(t_1)\\cdots\\mathrm{cur}(t_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cur}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq c_f\\mathrm{cur}(t_1)\\cdots\\mathrm{cur}(t_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}:V\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{cur}(l),\\mathrm{cur}(r)):(l,r)\\in R\\},\\qquad\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}(x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cur}(\\sigma(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}:V\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{cur}(l),\\mathrm{cur}(r)):(l,r)\\in R\\},\\qquad\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}(x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cur}(\\sigma(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 3.3.24（印刷 p74，OCR 页块95）。原签名与新签名显式分离，原常元也取对应副本。正元函数变为可应用常元，规则用同一项翻译。cur 按有限源项的真子项递归，值总是合法目标应用项；变量分支给出恒等变量，零元分支给出常元副本。因此函数图全定义且单值，σ 的总定义性也给出 σ^cur 的总定义性。显式类型声明与既有一步模拟的使用域一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-applicative-trs","status":"resolved","id":"1da4ab3df97a0b08","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-applicative-trs]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ap}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\cup V\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c_f","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\mathrm{ar}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"t_1,\\ldots,t_n\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"c_ft_1\\cdots t_n","display":false},{"tex":"F_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Ap}\\}\\cup\\{c_f:f\\in F\\},\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(\\mathsf{Ap})\\coloneqq2,\\quad\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}(c_f)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq(F_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\mathrm{ar}_{\\mathrm{cur}}).","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{cur}},V),\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}:T\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cur}(x)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\\mathrm{cur}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\coloneqq c_f\\mathrm{cur}(t_1)\\cdots\\mathrm{cur}(t_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}:V\\to T_{\\mathrm{cur}},\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{cur}}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{cur}(l),\\mathrm{cur}(r)):(l,r)\\in R\\},\\qquad\\sigma^{\\mathrm{cur}}(x)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{cur}(\\sigma(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":2062,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-currying.md]]"},{"id":"95ecedf3a005e045","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-currying]] 的源系统与柯里化系统，$s,t\\in\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$，$\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,V)$。"}],"outgoing":["1da4ab3df97a0b08","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}